      "writtenOn": "2013-06-06T17:48:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we need two mangers?  Seems like it should be one, with ability to multiplex between a wide array of drivers, but each backing a different format. By having two, we are extending a pattern that may not be correct for our usage.",
      "revId": "f34e8e8c8822b864f163d24b2c4c5ed3cc8b80ea",
